///
/// Contract: `VG.Spec.MlKem.checkEkContract`. Constant time: only the pointer may affect timing.
///
/// # Safety
///
/// * `ek` must be valid for reads of 1184 bytes.
/// * `ek` must not wrap around the end of the address space (no Rust object does).
#[unsafe(naked)]
